1
00:00:00,966 --> 00:00:03,033
This single guide has more possible paths

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:05,933
than Wikipedia has pages.

3
00:00:06,099 --> 00:00:06,700
But to the reader,

4
00:00:06,866 --> 00:00:08,833
it is just prose.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,099
Watch.

6
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:12,033
Two readers.

7
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:13,599
Two different paths.

8
00:00:13,766 --> 00:00:15,900
The guide adapts.

9
00:00:16,066 --> 00:00:16,600
Here,

10
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:18,233
both paths merge.

11
00:00:18,399 --> 00:00:19,366
The same source.

12
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:20,100
Referenced,

13
00:00:20,266 --> 00:00:21,566
not copied.

14
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:22,933
In a linear document,

15
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,000
this would be two guides to maintain.

16
00:00:25,166 --> 00:00:25,633
Here,

17
00:00:25,766 --> 00:00:27,399
it is one source.

18
00:00:27,566 --> 00:00:29,133
The paths diverge again.

19
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Different effort.

20
00:00:30,466 --> 00:00:32,100
Same tower.  

21
00:00:32,266 --> 00:00:37,066
And merge.

22
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:38,299
Same crops.

23
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,733
Different paths.

24
00:00:39,899 --> 00:00:40,700
One edit.

25
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:43,766
Every branch updated.

26
00:00:43,933 --> 00:00:49,399
The detail is there.

27
00:00:49,566 --> 00:00:51,466
But not in the way.

28
00:00:52,766 --> 00:00:54,466
Complex, branching knowledge.

29
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:56,566
Maintained like a single document.

30
00:00:56,733 --> 00:00:57,700
Delivered like prose.

